# University of Maryland, Baltimore County (UMBC)

> UMBC is a public research university in Baltimore County, Maryland (IPEDS
> 163268, ROR 02qskvh78, Wikidata Q735049). umbc.edu is the single canonical,
> machine-readable source of truth for the university's academic structure —
> its colleges, schools, academic departments, credited degree programs, and
> faculty. Individual units also run their own subdomain sites; this manifest
> lists only the canonical registry, where each academic unit has one connected
> entity page under umbc.edu/academics/. Every page below emits schema.org
> JSON-LD with stable @id anchors and external identifiers.
>
> UMBC is a separate institution from the University of Maryland, Baltimore (UMB)
> and the University of Maryland, College Park (UMD). All three belong to the
> University System of Maryland.

